{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl clutching her pillow accidentally falls into a nightmarish world. Here, she encounters Mona, a mysterious girl who is also trapped\u2014strikingly similar to her, yet wielding the power to control time and space. To her surprise, the soft pillow in her arms becomes both shield and weapon against the threats that lurk within. Facing the malice of this world, the two embark on an adventure together, supporting each other, growing stronger, and learning to embrace their own flaws. On this endless journey, they rescue companions, uncover the truth behind this world, and dream of escaping this unknown realm...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Explore a Crumbling Dream World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the pillow-wielding girl through shadow-consumed ruins, tread carefully through fog-laden wastelands, and descend into the cold depths of dark dungeons. In this twisted yet fantastical dreamscape, collect scattered memory fragments and mysterious emblems, rescue trapped companions, grow stronger, unlock new skills, and gradually uncover the truth hidden behind this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Control Two Characters in Co-op Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa transforms her beloved pillow into an unbreakable shield, protecting her partner in moments of crisis. Mona's wild hair tears through the air, unleashing fierce attacks to crush powerful foes. Freely switch between both characters mid-battle, shifting between offense and defense in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/303405a88decf6166c5df9082ffd248a.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/303405a88decf6166c5df9082ffd248a.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/303405a88decf6166c5df9082ffd248a.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Freely Build Your Badge</strong>\u00a0<strong>Loadout</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mysterious badges scattered throughout the dream world and combine them to create unique combat effects. Balance your choices within limited equipment slots, adapt to the battlefield, and craft a fighting style that's truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/d403880e42923a2b90334917448bf916.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/d403880e42923a2b90334917448bf916.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/d403880e42923a2b90334917448bf916.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Face Intense Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lords of this otherworld await your challenge. Each boss fight is the ultimate test of reflexes and strategy. Study your opponent's moves, seize fleeting openings, and execute perfect parries to turn the tide. Build up stun damage until they falter, then strike decisively with a devastating finishing blow. Experience the thrill of heart-pounding combat in high-stakes exchanges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/a881b3f5c70fdc7738b78ac07d0f63ec.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/a881b3f5c70fdc7738b78ac07d0f63ec.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/a881b3f5c70fdc7738b78ac07d0f63ec.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Conquer Perilous Parkour and Puzzle Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Navigate crumbling platforms and warped physics, dodging deadly traps in the nick of time. Leap with precision through treacherous terrain to reach hidden areas. Solve mechanical puzzles blocking your path, and find the only way out in a perilous three-dimensional labyrinth\u2014the sole path leading to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/23932fb0bce3d4040bc970a6910ea786.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/23932fb0bce3d4040bc970a6910ea786.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/23932fb0bce3d4040bc970a6910ea786.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866890?t=1772766530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/e01ecdf3dede096d2e41098265fb65d4d276527c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772766530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/3530abff932e55a54663eba19d70dfaf09c1eebb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772766530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/3530abff932e55a54663eba19d70dfaf09c1eebb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772766530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3973130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/826e23ab47fe6e29f0f9e2533bbe167c.avif?t=1772766530\" width=800 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl clutching her pillow accidentally falls into a nightmarish world. Here, she encounters Mona, a mysterious girl who is also trapped\u2014strikingly similar to her, yet wielding the power to control time and space. To her surprise, the soft pillow in her arms becomes both shield and weapon against the threats that lurk within. Facing the malice of this world, the two embark on an adventure together, supporting each other, growing stronger, and learning to embrace their own flaws. On this endless journey, they rescue companions, uncover the truth behind this world, and dream of escaping this unknown realm...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Explore a Crumbling Dream World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the pillow-wielding girl through shadow-consumed ruins, tread carefully through fog-laden wastelands, and descend into the cold depths of dark dungeons. In this twisted yet fantastical dreamscape, collect scattered memory fragments and mysterious emblems, rescue trapped companions, grow stronger, unlock new skills, and gradually uncover the truth hidden behind this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.poster.avif?t=1772766530\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.webm?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866890/extras/429891d348e61b3f9cfb4ce63da0c175.mp4?t=1772766530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas